text 3462 golden/err_target.out
Usage: autofidseed [Options]
Options can be abbreviated, current short name abbreviations are in parentheses
Options:
 -track (-tr)  OR  -TrackCommandFile   File
    Command file for running Beadtrack
 -append (-ap)  OR  -AppendToSeedModel
    Read in existing output seed model and add points to it
 -guess (-g)  OR  -MinGuessNumBeads   Int
    A guess for the minimum number of beads present
 -spacing (-sp)  OR  -MinSpacing   Float
    Minimum spacing between peaks as fraction of bead size (default 0.85)
 -size (-si)  OR  -BeadSize   Float
    Diameter of beads in images to track, in pixels
 -adjust (-ad)  OR  -AdjustSizes
    Change size-based parameters using measured size of averaged bead
 -peak (-pe)  OR  -PeakStorageFraction   Float
    Fraction of peaks above histogram dip to store in model (default 1.0)
 -find (-f)  OR  -FindBeadOptions   String
    One or more options to pass to ImodFindBeads
 -views (-v)  OR  -NumberOfSeedViews   Int
    Number of views at which to find seed points for tracking beads
 -shifts (-sh)  OR  -ShiftsNearZeroFraction   Float
    Fraction of box size at which to supply shifts near zero tilt to Beadtrack
 -justshifts (-j)  OR  -JustFindShiftsNearZero   Int
    Estimated number of beads for just finding the shifts near zero tilt
 -boundary (-bou)  OR  -BoundaryModel   File
    Model containing contours enclosing areas in which to find or exclude
    beads
 -exclude (-ex)  OR  -ExcludeInsideAreas
    Use the boundary model to exclude regions from analysis
 -border (-bor)  OR  -BordersInXandY   2 ints
    Number of pixels to exclude near each edge in X and in Y
 -two (-tw)  OR  -TwoSurfaces
    Try to find an equal number of beads on two surfaces
 -number (-n)  OR  -TargetNumberOfBeads   Int
    Desired total number of beads to choose for final seed model
 -density (-de)  OR  -TargetDensityOfBeads   Float
    Desired density of beads in final seed model per binned 1K x 1K area
 -ratio (-ra)  OR  -MaxMajorToMinorRatio   Float
    Maximum ratio between beads on majority and minority surface
 -elongated (-el)  OR  -ElongatedPointsAllowed   Int
    1-3 to include elongated beads
 -cluster (-c)  OR  -ClusteredPointsAllowed   Int
    1 to include beads near others, 2-4 to include elongated beads also
 -lower (-lo)  OR  -LowerTargetForClustered   Float
    Include clustered/elongated points only if # is still below this target
 -subarea (-su)  OR  -SubareaSize   Int
    Size of subareas for Sortbeadsurfs analysis of two surfaces
 -sort (-so)  OR  -SortAreasMinNumAndSize   2 ints
    Minimum bead number and area size for having Sortbeadsurfs pick subareas
 -ignore (-ig)  OR  -IgnoreSurfaceData   List
    List of tracked models (numbered from 1) with bad top/bottom information
 -drop (-dr)  OR  -DropTracks   List
    List of tracked models (numbered from 1) to drop from the analysis
 -pick (-pi)  OR  -PickSeedOptions   String
    One or more options to pass to Pickbestseed
 -remove (-re)  OR  -RemoveTempFiles   Int
    Clean up temporary files from previous run and go on (1) or exit (-1)
 -output (-o)  OR  -OutputSeedModel   File
    Alternative path and name for output file for the seed model
 -info (-in)  OR  -InfoFile   File
    Alternative path and name for info file
 -tempdir (-te)  OR  -TemporaryDirectory   File
    Path for temporary directory
 -leave (-le)  OR  -LeaveTempFiles
    Leave temporary files in temporary directory
 -help (-h)  OR  -usage
    Print help output

